<h1>runhandshake
</h1>

<h2><a name="_name"></a>PURPOSE <a href="#_top"><img alt="^" border="0" src="../../up.png"></a></h2>
<div class="box"><strong>runhandshake(VarToGetty, statusFlag)</strong></div>

<h2><a name="_synopsis"></a>SYNOPSIS <a href="#_top"><img alt="^" border="0" src="../../up.png"></a></h2>
<div class="box"><strong>function runhandshake(VarToGetty, statusFlag) </strong></div>

<h2><a name="_description"></a>DESCRIPTION <a href="#_top"><img alt="^" border="0" src="../../up.png"></a></h2>
<div class="fragment"><pre class="comment"> runhandshake(VarToGetty, statusFlag)
 
   in, VarToGetty (float, i.e. double or single) is the vector'll send to 
       getty 
       statusFlag, 1 if you want cmdln output of badshake, 0 otherwise the
           default

 HC
 rbm 08.08 statusFlag  and breaksession
 rbm 6.11 try again loop
 rbm 11.11 non-integer and &gt;255 corrections/warnings
 global  breaksession
 persistent tries</pre></div>

